# freetype2.library function list - the single source of the LVO order.
#
# tools/genfuncs.py turns this into the library's function table and the
# client headers (fd, clib, inline, proto).
#
# Up to FT_Get_X11_Font_Format (LVO -720) the order is that of the AROS
# freetype2.library port that was compiled for AmigaOS 3 as
# freetype2.library 1.3 (util/libs/freetype2_lib on Aminet), checked
# against that binary: old programs find every function at the same
# offset. (AROS changed its own order in 2021; that order is not used.)
# AAText's freetype2.library (2.15; called aatext.library before) keeps
# this order, so programs written for freetype2.library 1.3 run unchanged.
#
#   - the bullet.library API first, arguments in registers;
#   - the FreeType API from LVO -90 on, arguments on the stack in the
#     normal C order (the library base in A6 is not used).
#
# ".skip n" reserves n slots; they return FT_Err_Unimplemented_Feature.
# (In 1.3 they held FreeType 2.1 internals and old cache functions.)
# Functions are only ever added at the end; nothing is removed or moved.

# bullet.library API
